<title>PHILIPPINES: Bacnotan Q1 net up at 105.8 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Bacnotan Q1 net up at 105.8 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bacnotan Consolidated Industries Inc said on Wednesday net income rose 78 percent to 105.8 million pesos in the first quarter ended September compared to the same period in 1995.</p>
</text>
